{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0082_1000_030iku", "source_sha256": "6123f50eb985c495d54347eccdaed4be2e7a5538515f52efcffc969ac7a0a6d4", "ja": "ふんふんふん……♪\n色をぬって……よーし、でーきたっ！", "zh": "哼哼哼……♪\n涂上颜色……好，完～成了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0082_1001_p", "source_sha256": "2c84cca0c3c4402d62fa8ff9fa43fef68f1db05139318f3853de7b2ff93d6179", "ja": "（控え室から、楽しそうな声がしてくる。\n育が、何か作業をしているみたいだけど……）", "zh": "（准备室那边传来欢乐的声音。\n育好像在制作什么东西……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0082_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f61ef115fbc2b6b2d19f9ebac110aecaf138fec69522c837eff0f491ec4d51d4", "ja": "育、ずいぶんと楽しそうじゃないか。\n何か作ってたのか？", "zh": "育，你看起来挺开心的。\n是在做什么东西吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0082_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "9607151a4d62bbd8bf9a5af2ad8d809445132ee58b875da44add9e55d1d9ec8c", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！　あのね、\n今度、劇場のみんなと海に行くでしょ？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n你听我说，下次剧场的大家不是要一起去海边吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0082_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "128bd98033c9b35c9d3fd3064e56a68cef1119f027179038210a76173a90a61e", "ja": "だから、ちゃんと晴れますようにって、\nてるてるぼーずを作ったんだ。おまじない！", "zh": "所以我正在做晴天娃娃，\n施展会让那天放晴的魔法！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0082_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7257a6de42ffee62ce2da813fd4812042e17ac15093b4521572a6634b37f10b5", "ja": "お、それはいいアイディアだな。……でも、\nなんだか変わったデザインのてるてる坊主だな……？", "zh": "哦，这主意真不错……不过，\n你这晴天娃娃的设计怎么感觉有点奇特……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0082_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "4906ffbebe695748453d2700b3cb841332766856e86b67c085f6e33aadd0c5ca", "ja": "わかった！？　あのね、これは桃子ちゃんの\nかっこうをした、桃子ちゃんぼーずなんだよ♪", "zh": "你看出来啦！？\n我跟你说，这是桃子造型的桃子娃娃喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0082_1007_p", "source_sha256": "764bae0c8a49872b87bf66f4b306e750c2c6e5ec2c0940efde8c84603ede9e51", "ja": "なるほど、言われてみると確かに桃子に似てるような。\nじゃあこっちは……。", "zh": "原来如此，你这么一说的确有点像桃子。\n那这个是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0082_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "da437ec2a8aeeb62c603a7cf55d0401d5a0fa4455c1e95bdda8e9b33e6220222", "ja": "こっちは、小鳥さんぼーず！\n他のみんなも、これから作ろうと思ってるんだ♪", "zh": "这个是小鸟姊姊娃娃！\n我正打算接着做其他人的呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0082_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "f0c567c1a1a926e9a0a6f2ce834d0da29d55f302899d41dc37268dfbfc18eb3b", "ja": "{$P$}さんぼーずも\n作ってあげるから、楽しみにまっててね！", "zh": "到时候也会做{$P$}先生的娃娃，\n你就好好期待成品吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0082_1010_p", "source_sha256": "cf8222a5df01f5366c50e237b8e1e41a88dc40868e94e39a668d07c2dae2acf8", "ja": "（育のおまじないが効いたのか、海水浴は晴れだった。\n……てるてる坊主、バカにできないな！）", "zh": "（也许是育的祈祷奏效了，去海边那天是大晴天。\n……晴天娃娃，不容小觑啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
